distance-2 pairs, appended. A proper colouring of it is exactly a proper colouring of the
unit graph that avoids every monochromatic distance-2 pair (the bridge,
`Pigeonhole.lean`) — which is why one ordinary graph refutation certifies the pigeonhole.
-/

